description	"Death Trooper

Relatively slow but hard hitting soldiers with suppression weaponry and tough armor.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 35% faster RoF
-- 20% less damage
- DLT-19D Blaster Rifle (3)
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 25% less FP drain
-- Heavyweight
- Frag Grenade (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Assemble (2)
- 12% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]"